      author: "Verified Amazon Buyer",
      stars: 4
    },
    highlights: [
      "Slip-on design — no hassle, no laces",
      "Thin sole with soft cushioning",
      "Classic retro styling",
      "Lightweight for all-day wear"
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 4,
    name: "Women's Fashion Classic Retro Sneakers",
    shortName: "Feminine Lace Detail Sneakers",
