    ],
    affiliateLink: "https://amzn.to/4sCoMHt",
    tagline: "Feminine lace detailing + soft sole",
    benefit: "Best for Feminine Style",
    review: {
      title: "Love These! So Cute & Comfy",
      text: "These are a great Mary Jane! I was unsure if I should order my regular 9 or size down to 8.5. I am glad I went with the 9, perfect fit and I will be able to wear with light bobby sock or no socks. They are really cute and will match with everything this spring/summer/fall. I would buy another color if they offered them with the lace detailing.",
      author: "Verified Amazon Buyer",
      stars: 5
